  <section id="eligibility">
    <h2>
      Who Can Use Open Citadel
    </h2>
    <p>
      You must be at least 13 years old, or older if the law where you
      live sets a higher age for using an online service like this
      without a parent's consent. Open Citadel is not directed at
      children under 13.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you are under 18, you may use the app only with the permission
      of a parent or guardian, and a parent or guardian must be the one
      to buy a subscription. By using the app you confirm you meet these
      requirements and that you are able to enter into this agreement.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may not use the app if you are barred from doing so by law, or
      if we have ended your access for breaking these terms.
    </p>
  </section>

